---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {shop} from '../../data/shop';
const questions=[['How do I buy a piece?','Click a product or visit our Depop profile. Read the listing and complete your purchase on Depop. This website does not take payments.'],['How do I know it will fit?','Vintage sizing can differ from modern sizing. Check the listing’s measurements against a piece you already own, and ask the seller on Depop if you need more details.'],['What condition should I expect?','Vintage clothes have a history. Review the product photos and condition notes on each Depop listing before you buy.'],['What about shipping and returns?','Check the seller’s current information and the terms shown on Depop before purchasing. Shipping, returns, and buyer support are handled there.'],['How do I care for vintage clothing?','Start with the garment’s care label. Use gentle washing and air drying when appropriate, and seek specialist advice for delicate fabrics or leather.'],['Is the guestbook public?','No. Guestbook notes are saved only in your current browser, on your device. They are not sent to Afterglow or shared with other visitors.'],['Where’s that music coming from?','The optional Afterglow Radio makes an original little tune in your browser. It only plays after you press Play. Press Stop any time.'],['Are the lookbook photos products for sale?','The lookbook uses original generated editorial art for styling inspiration. Product cards show the real Depop listings.']];
---
<Layout title="Help! Good questions, useful answers" description="How to shop Afterglow Vintage on Depop, check measurements, care for vintage clothes, and use this retro website." current="faq/">
<section class="page-heading"><span>AFTERGLOW ONLINE / HELP DESK</span><h1>YOU HAVE<br/><em>QUESTIONS.</em></h1><p>We have a very useful text file.</p></section>
<section class="inner-content faq-list">{questions.map(([question,answer])=><details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}<p class="help-footer">Need a hand with a piece? <a href={shop.depopUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message us on Depop ↗</a></p></section>
</Layout>
